EXTERNAL flag(name)
Skögul hands you a grey feather, curled at the tip.
"Some of the fallen are only mostly dead. Hold this under their nose. If it stirs, stamp RETURN and send them home." # speaker: skogul
"It costs daylight, so save it for the ones whose breath fogs, not every corpse that looks sleepy." # speaker: skogul
{ flag("asked_about_lies"):
  "And yes, the mostly dead lie too. They think they're dreaming." # speaker: skogul
}
* ["How do they get back?"]
  "Badly. They wake in a ditch with a headache and a story nobody believes." # speaker: skogul
* ["Has anyone ever come back twice?"]
  Skögul looks at the queue for a long moment.
  "One. You'll meet him." # speaker: skogul
